# The guardrail guards itself. Changes to the policy, the detectors, the workflows and
# the hooks are exactly the assets a bypass would target, so they require a code-owner
# review — the human half of the sign-off model in SPEC §5.4. Pair this with branch
# protection ("Require review from Code Owners") or it is advisory only.
/.tamperward.yml        @hexrift
/.github/               @hexrift
/.husky/                @hexrift
/src/detectors/         @hexrift
/src/policy.ts          @hexrift
/src/policy-load.ts     @hexrift
